'''Insanity''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete [[Perfect Wardens]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid at level 300 or above.

== Strategy ==
As death invocations do not need to be enabled, players can all die and re-attempt Wardens without having to redo the entire raid.

